  "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
  "format-version": "0.1",
  "name": "Sarek: End-to-End Genomic Variant Calling Pipeline",
  "annotation": "End-to-end Galaxy implementation of nf-core/sarek: read QC, BWA-MEM2 alignment, GATK MarkDuplicates & BQSR, germline (Strelka, HaplotypeCaller, FreeBayes) and somatic (Mutect2) calling, structural variants (Manta), SnpEff annotation, and MultiQC reporting.",
